# OPUS-TYPED-BINDING-20260930-20, next_core_tasks.md §3 item 207: b already bound: `Model: b c` is Model's call with b and c --
# never a second declaration, no fallback -- refused where it stands by its arity: an ordinary named Structure has no
# arguments (docs :668).  With b absent the line is the same call (K03 NS-ROLES-CALL, unit_bind_root_ref).
Model:
    size_t: value 1U
end: Model

Other:
    int: p 1
    int: q 2
end: Other

int: out 0
c: merge: Model
b: merge: Model
Model: b c
out: 7
sendMessage: exit(exit_code: out; stdout: ""; stderr: "")
return
